  "steps": [
    "Heat 1 tsp oil in a pan, add cumin seeds, then sauté mushrooms and tempeh crumbles until lightly browned.",
    "Add tomato puree and cook it down until thick.",
    "Season with red chilli, garam masala, coriander powder, jeera powder, salt and pepper. Cook until water fully evaporates.",
    "Combine Greek yoghurt, mint, garlic powder, honey, salt and pepper.",
    "Assemble the wrap- Mash avocado, add lettuce, sautéed tempeh-mushroom filling, and chopped veggies on the whole-wheat wrap.",
    "Serve - Roll tightly and serve with the mint yogurt dip. Enjoy warm!"
  ],
